          "title": "Critical Abelian Higgs fields, winding and divisor data",
          "statement": "For e>0, xi>0 define smooth real U(1) connection A on R2, q:R2->C, D=d-iA, B=dA12, energy int[B\u00b2/(2e\u00b2)+|Dq|\u00b2+e\u00b2(|q|\u00b2-xi)\u00b2/2], winding n at infinity and the finite divisor sum m_j[z_j] of degree |n| with arbitrary distinct centers and positive multiplicities. Define gauges, decay/boundary conditions and scalar Taubes h problem exactly.",
